---
// The cable on the right: a tangle at the bottom, one end running up to plug into
// the side of the set, five small drawings of things he has tried, and two notes.
// The line is the approved artwork, unchanged. The drawings are the approved ones
// at one and a half times their size, each scaled about its own middle.
//
// The phone has a drawing of its own, kept in a box of its own (below).
//
// The notes are read from the top: the first above the drawings, the second beside
// the tangle. In the opening "tried a lot of things" comes in first, as the line
// starts; then the drawings, one after another; then "stayed for the ones that fix
// a real problem", once the last drawing is in (`scripts/scene.ts` has the times).
// The first is `.note-run` and the second `.note-tangle`, the names the opening
// finds them by.
import { NOTES } from '../data/site';
---

